      "answer_outline": "The candidate should mention specific techniques like using ARIA labels for dynamic data, managing focus states in complex grids, and ensuring keyboard navigation is intuitive. A strong answer will demonstrate an understanding of how WCAG guidelines apply specifically to data-heavy interfaces rather than just general web content.",
